      "content_hash": "d08adabd38424def5d6a541f52a6af2ebd2972f3e5eb6e8a1a81c0613ef9b044",
      "content": "# Schema contract mismatch — version 1 — 2026-10-20\nSymptoms: missing_column, column amount does not exist, stg_orders.\nConfirm: selected dbt invocation and task log name the missing column; compare current raw.orders with orders-v1 baseline. A current observation is not a snapshot of the failed execution.\nAction: a developer verifies the producer contract and aligns source mapping or dependent model SQL after review. Preserve source data and record the mapping decision.\nPrerequisite: confirm intended meaning of amount and paid_amount; establish which contract is authoritative.\nVerification: new execution has all tasks successful and not_null/unique tests passing; inspect daily_orders aggregate.\nExclude: connection refusal, unrelated current schema, and data-quality-only failures. A retry alone does not fix this mismatch.\n",
      "method": "lexical_overlap_checkpoint"
    },
    {
      "doc_id": "rb-connection",
      "doc_version": "1",
